<title>USA: Renters Choice acquires 11 stores.</title>
<headline>Renters Choice acquires 11 stores.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Renters Choice Inc said it acquired 11 rental purchase stores for an undisclosed amount of cash in three separate transactions.</p>
<p>The company said the recent acquisitions consist of two stores in New Hampshire, two in Massachusetts, two in Mississippi and five in Florida.</p>
<p>Renters Choice said the combined annual revenues for the purchased stores are in excess of $5 million.</p>
<p>Renters Choice is the operator of rental purchase stores and franchisor of rent-to-own stores through its wholly owned unit ColorTyme Inc.</p>
</text>
